MapName=Arrival
Brief_1=... Looks like teleportation has gone wrong. At the Unicorn Academy they said that this happens once in a thousand. I need to find the portal, establish contact with the base and find out my main task.
Brief_2_1=I see machines that may have been left over from the last expedition. I can use them.
Brief_2_2=You can find useful self-propelled machines that can transform into stationary defensive or harvesting structures. The transformation is irreversible. A unicorn is required to activate an abandoned car.
Brief_3=I see a portal!
Brief_M=Great, these machines will come in handy.
Task1=Find a portal
Task2=Find all machines (optional)
